  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU; every value is a holding register, read only. The document numbers the registers from 1 relative to 40.000 and does not say whether that number is sent as is; it is used here as the address on the wire. If every value looks shifted by one register, use address base 1.",
    "Serial speed 1200 to 57600 bit/s (or automatic detection), 8 data bits, 1 stop bit; parity none, even or odd. 9600 8N1 is assumed here.",
    "The serial number is 24 bits: the low 16 bits in register 12 and the high 8 bits in register 13.",
    "Written from the register map; this map has not been tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "unit_id": 1,
